            <div xml:id="d307">

                <pb facs="0357" n="345" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg345"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">760H.68/10–345: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacVeagh</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Athens</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-03T19:00:00+02:00">October 3, 1945—7
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 4—5:34 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1119. See my despatch 1518, Sept 12.<anchor n="82" xml:id="d307-f1"/> In strictly
                    confidential note, Foreign Office states that according recent information 700
                    Greek hostages taken by EAM are now in Albanian concentration camp at Lesh
                    (Alessio) 20 kilometers from Skutari. Note requests US Mission Tirana undertake
                    rapid and secret investigation to uncover this camp which Hoxha has been able
                    conceal till now and would immediately move elsewhere at first alert exposing
                    inmates grave dangers. Note concludes: “The Royal Minister deems that this
                    question is so closely related to the basic moral principles of the United
                    Nations that nothing should be neglected which might aid in finding traces of
                    those who have disappeared and putting an end to an intolerable abuse.”</p>
                <p>Sent Dept as 1119 for such instructions as deemed advisable to Tirana and
                    repeated Tirana for information.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">MacVeagh</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
